Value VRP_VERSION (\S+)
Value PRODUCT_VERSION (.+)
Value MODEL (.+?)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value PATCH_VERSION (\S+)

Start
  ^(?:HUAWEI|Huawei)\s+Versatile\s+Routing\s+Platform\s+Software\s*$$
  ^.*software,\s+Version\s+${VRP_VERSION}\s+\(${PRODUCT_VERSION}\)\s*$$
  ^Copyright.*(?:Huawei|HUAWEI).*
  ^(?:HUAWEI|Huawei)\s+${MODEL}\s+Router\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Quidway\s+${MODEL}\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Patch\s+[Vv]ersion\s*:\s*${PATCH_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s*<[A-Za-z0-9_\-\.]+>.*$$
  ^.*>\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
